%% HAND-AUTHORED — sys-05 §6 admin endpoints + §16 red-team gate (no sequenceDiagram in spec).
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant AdminConsole
    participant SafetyService
    participant PostgreSQL
    participant Redis
    participant RedTeamRunner

    AdminConsole->>SafetyService: POST /internal/v1/admin/blocklists {patterns, version}
    alt rbac_denied
        SafetyService-->>AdminConsole: 403 admin RBAC failed
    else regex_compile_failed
        SafetyService->>SafetyService: validate each regex compiles
        SafetyService-->>AdminConsole: 400 pattern compile error
    else regex_catastrophic_backtracking
        SafetyService->>SafetyService: run 10000-char adversarial probe per pattern
        Note over SafetyService: probe exceeds 50ms — reject pattern
        SafetyService-->>AdminConsole: 400 catastrophic_backtracking
    else safe_word_false_positive
        SafetyService->>SafetyService: probe safe words (hello, play, friend, ...)
        SafetyService-->>AdminConsole: 400 false_positive_on_safe_word
    else red_team_regression
        SafetyService->>RedTeamRunner: run 40+ red-team suite
        RedTeamRunner-->>SafetyService: 1 of 40 unsafe inputs passed
        Note over SafetyService: zero-tolerance — block publish
        SafetyService-->>AdminConsole: 409 red_team_regression
    else success
        SafetyService->>SafetyService: validate, probe, red-team suite green
        SafetyService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT blocklist_versions row and activate
        SafetyService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT audit event
        SafetyService->>Redis: DEL blocklist:active
        SafetyService-)SafetyService: emit conv-policy-publish fanout
        SafetyService-->>AdminConsole: 200 {version_id, activated_at}
    end
    Note over AdminConsole,RedTeamRunner: every admin endpoint requires RBAC, writes audit, invalidates Redis caches on publish
